ENTRY            D1096   20260520   20261124   20261124       D153
SUBENT        D1096001   20260520   20261124   20261124       D153
BIB                 11         32
TITLE      Elastic and inelastic scattering of 12C on 64Zn at
            energies near the Coulomb barrier
AUTHOR     (L.Garrido-Gomez, E.Lopez-Miguelez,
            J.P.Fernandez-Garcia, M.A.G.Alvarez, L.M.Martinis,
            J.K.L.Chaves, G.P.Cessel, W.A.Y.Hatano, V.Scarduelli,
            L.R.Gasques, L.C.Chamon, A.Arazi, A.Vegas-Diaz,
            G.L.Guardo)
INSTITUTE  (2SPNSEU,3BZLUSP,3ARGCNE,3ARGCIN,2ITYCAT)
REFERENCE  (J,PR/C,113,044607,2026)
FACILITY   (VDGT,3BZLUSP) 8 MV Pelletron accelerator
SAMPLE     A compound target with a carbon backing (21 ug/cm2),
            64Zn (41 ug/cm2) and 5 ug/cm2 of bismuth was employed.
DETECTOR   (TELES,SISD,SISD) Two large area telescopes (50 x
            50 mm2) composed by:
           . two 20 um single-sided Si strip telescopes segmented
             into 16 vertical strips, as energy loss (dE)
             detectors.
           . two 300 um SSSSD detectors segmented in 16 horizontal
             strips as residual energy (E) detectors.
           The two telescopes were centered at angle 110 and
            150 degree, mounted at distance of 11 cm from the
            target.
           (SIBAR) Two Si surface barrier detectors at 30 and
            40 degree at distance of 25 cm from the target for
            normalization purpose.
           (SIBAR) Three Si surface barrier detectors at 50, 60,
            70 degree placed at distance of 30 cm from the target.
METHOD     (EDE)
STATUS     (APRVD) Proofread by Lucas Garrido Gomez (2026-05-20)
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-S) Statistical uncertainty
HISTORY    (20260519R) VT. Data received from Lucas Garrido Gomez.
           (20260520C) VT
ENDBIB              32
NOCOMMON             0          0
ENDSUBENT           35
